<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Got Questions?</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Everything you need to know about BelleAura Beauty Salon</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="faq-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-container">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do I need to make an appointment?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We strongly recommend booking an appointment to ensure availability. Walk-ins are welcome based on availability, but appointment guarantees you a dedicated slot with your stylist or technician.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What is your cancellation policy?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We require 24-hour notice for cancellations. Cancellations made less than 24 hours in advance may incur a 50% service fee. No-shows will be charged the full service amount.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What products do you use?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We use only premium, professional-grade products from trusted brands including Olaplex, Kerastase, SkinCeuticals, OPI, and Dermalogica. All products are carefully selected for their quality, safety, and effectiveness.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do you offer bridal packages?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! We offer comprehensive bridal packages including trial sessions, day-of hair and makeup, bridal party services, and day-of touch-ups. We recommend booking bridal services 3-6 months in advance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Are you located near the City in Kansas City?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! BelleAura Beauty Salon is conveniently located at 4820 JCT Country Club Road in Kansas City, MO 64112. We are easily accessible from downtown Kansas City, Overland Park, Prairie Village, and Lee's Summit with free parking available for our clients.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do you offer gift cards?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! BelleAura gift cards make the perfect gift for any occasion. Available in any denomination, they can be purchased in-store or by calling our salon. Gift cards never expire.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What payment methods do you accept?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We accept cash, all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover), debit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and BelleAura gift cards. Payment is due at the time of service.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Can I bring inspiration photos to my appointment?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Absolutely! We love seeing your inspiration photos. They help us understand what you love and customize our services to match your vision. We'll discuss the look during your consultation to ensure achievable, beautiful results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do you offer hair extensions?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! We offer professional hair extensions including tape-in, sew-in, and clip-in options. Our stylists are trained in extension application and can help you choose the right type for your hair and lifestyle.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What if I'm not happy with my service?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Your satisfaction is our top priority. If you're not completely satisfied, please contact us within 7 days of your service, and we'll work with you to make it right — whether that's a complimentary redo, adjustment, or other resolution.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-5">
      <p class="cta-text-large">Have a question we haven't answered?</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Contact Us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>